  era: "Neolithic \xB7 Section 1 \xB7 Prehistoric India \xB7 c. 1.5 million years ago \u2013 700 BCE"
  title: Neolithic sites
  text: Key Neolithic sites include Mehrgarh in Balochistan, Burzahom and Gufkral in Kashmir, Chirand in Bihar, Koldihwa and Lahuradewa in Uttar Pradesh, Daojali Hading in Assam, and Brahmagiri, Maski, Piklihal and Utnur in the Deccan.
